{
  "series_title": "Yuu☆Yuu☆Hakusho",
  "research_status": "COMPLETE — all 112 episodes of Yu Yu Hakusho classified canon/filler/mixed. This is a genuinely low-filler show (4 pure-filler episodes total), corroborated by two independently-fetched sources (epicdope.com, QuoteTheAnime) agreeing exactly on 107-109 and 111 as the only pure filler. Episodes 11 and 13 are recorded as mixed ('mostly canon' per QuoteTheAnime) but backed by only one source — epicdope's own guide didn't call these two out separately from the surrounding canon run, so this isn't independently corroborated the way the pure-filler episodes are. QuoteTheAnime's own stated total (114 episodes, with a 5th filler episode at 114) doesn't match this project's AniList-sourced catalog entry (112 episodes, confirmed via a direct AniList API check) — disregarded as out of scope, the same kind of guide-site episode-count confusion already hit with Rurouni Kenshin earlier in this same research batch. No episode titles included — left for the existing backfill_episode_titles_from_anilist.py (#73) pass. Complete, gap-free, non-overlapping coverage of 1-112 confirmed before writing this file.",
